    - responseText: I told him I'd get his brooch back
      friendshipThreshold: 0
      nextNode:
        dialogueText: 'Bonk: And what?<0.3> </>It doesn''t sound like you''ll give
          it back even if you do get it!'
        responses:
        - responseText: I'll give it back
          friendshipThreshold: 0
          nextNode:
            dialogueText: 'Zonk: Had us worried there for a second'
            responses:
            - responseText: End Conversation
              friendshipThreshold: 0
              nextNode:
